l; color: initial; font-size: initial;"><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;"><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/d/edit?mid=1AAQhEIPsZDnawtk2JEjE7gOV4Rgwz3c&usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Google Map Link</strong></a>&nbsp;</li><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;" data-pasted="true"><a href="https://updates.electionlink.net/widgets/ellistx/2026-11-03/Election%20Day%20Voting%20Dashboard.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>View Election Day Wait Times</strong></a></li></ul></li><li style="color: rgb(69, 19, 5); font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;" data-pasted="true"><strong>Sample Ballots &nbsp;</strong><ul style="color: initial; font-size: initial;"><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;"><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/23936" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Generic Sample Ballot</strong></a></li><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;"><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/23942" target="_blank" rel="noopener">List of Declared Write-in Candidates for Ellis County</a></li><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;"><a href="https://www.elliscountytx.gov/1368/Individual-Sample-Ballot-By-Precinct-110" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Individual Sample Ballot</strong></a><strong>&nbsp;</strong></li></ul></li><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;">Early Voting In-Person Roster Report (zipped file) - coming after early voting begins</li><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px;"><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/24178/1126Nov-Election_EVReports_Mail"><strong>Returned Ballots by Mail Roster Report &nbsp;(zipped file)</strong></a></li><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;"><strong>Daily Summary Early Voting Report (PDF) - coming after early voting begins</strong></li></ul><p><br></p><ul><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;"><strong>Wednesday, January 1, 2026 - First day for the Elections office to receive a Regular or FPCA Ballot by mail application for this Election.&nbsp;</strong><ul><li style="font-size: 18px; color: rgb(69, 19, 5);"><a href="http://www.co.ellis.tx.us/739/Early-Voting-Information" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: rgb(69, 19, 5); font-size: 18px;"><strong>Click here for more voting by mail information</strong></a></li></ul></li><li style="font-size: 18px;"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><strong>Monday, October 5, 2026 - Last day to register to vote for this Election.</strong></span></p><ul><li style="font-size: 18px;"><a href="https://www.co.ellis.tx.us/740/Voter-Registration-Information" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="font-size: 18px;"><strong>Click here for more&nbsp;information on registering to vote</strong></a></li></ul></li><li style="font-size: 18px;"><p>&nbsp;<span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><strong>Friday, October 23, 2026 - Last day for the Elections office to receive a Regular or FPCA ballot by mail application.&nbsp;</strong></span></strong></span></p><ul><li style="font-size: 18px;"><p><a aria-label="Click here for a Regular Absentee Application Opens in new window" href="http://www.co.ellis.tx.us/DocumentCenter/View/5878" rel="noopener" target="_blank" style="font-size: 18px;" data-docaccess-source-url="https://elliscountytx.gov/DocumentCenter/View/5878" data-url-hash="6ecd282ca65f562b5bb391dd191f328ec90febb646a42968646ccbf245497fc4" data-url-status="disabled"><strong>Click here for a Regular Absentee Application</strong></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <strong>&nbsp;<a aria-label="(Click here for Spanish) Opens in new window" href="http://www.co.ellis.tx.us/DocumentCenter/View/9315/Ballot-by-Mail-Application---Revised-9-2021" rel="noopener" style="box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; user-select: auto; color: rgb(113, 46, 40); text-decoration: underline; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);" target="_blank" data-docaccess-source-url="http://www.co.ellis.tx.us/DocumentCenter/View/9315/Ballot-by-Mail-Application---Revised-9-2021" data-url-hash="632f36f68d0abf602a71e131db868e7bf460a525c2ff868292c1e3dfb37d2811" data-url-status="disabled">(Click here for Spanish)</a>&nbsp;</strong></p></li><li style="font-size: 18px;"><a aria-label="Click here for a FPCA Application Opens in new window" href="https://www.fvap.gov/vao/vag" rel="noopener" target="_blank" style="font-size: 18px;"><strong>Click here for a FPCA Application</strong></a><strong>&nbsp;(Absentee voting for Service members, their families and overseas citizens)</strong></li></ul></li></ul><p style="margin: 0in -22.5pt 0in 0in; font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;" data-pasted="true"><span style="color: rgb(0, 168, 133); font-size: 30px;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 30px;">_________________<span style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-size: 30px; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px;">______________________________</span></span></span></p><p style="text-align: left;"><strong><span style="font-size: 24px;">2026-2027 Election Dates </span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-size: 18px; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px;"> (Election Schedule/Dates are Subject to change)</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-size: 18px; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" id="isPasted"> </span><span style="color: rgb(184, 49, 47);"> <strong><span style="font-size: 18px;"><a href="http://www.co.ellis.tx.us/742/Elected-Officials-Candidate-Information">Click here to see Elected Officials Listing and Year of Re-Election and Candidate Filing Info</a></span></strong><strong><span style="font-size: 18px;"> </span></strong><strong><span style="font-size: 18px;"> </span></strong></span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><strong><span style="font-size: 18px;">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong></span></span></strong></p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><strong>2026 General Election (Gubernatorial) - &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></span></strong><strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><strong>Early Voting October 19-30; Election Day November 3, 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></span></strong><strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></strong></li></ul><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(250, 197, 28); font-size: 18px;" data-pasted="true">The dates below are subject to change based on the legislative session and/or the implementation of SB 2753.</span></p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><strong>2027 Local Political Subdivisions Joint General and Special Elections - &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></span></strong><strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><strong>Early Voting April 19-24, 26-27; Election Day May 1, 2027 &nbsp;</strong></span></span></strong><ul><li><strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><strong>(Possible Runoff June TBD)</strong></span></span></strong></li></ul></li><li><strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><strong>2027 Constitutional Amendment Election - &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></span></span></strong><strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><strong>Early Voting October 18-23, 25-29; Election Day November 2, 2027&nbsp;</strong></span></span></strong><strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></strong><ul><li><strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><strong><span style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-size: 14px; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-size: 18px; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px;"><strong style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;">(Possible Runoff December TBD)</strong></span></span>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></strong></li></ul></li></ul><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><strong><span style="font-size: 18px;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>